{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>Of Shupham, the Shuphamite family</b> — it should have said השפופמי. This hints that Benjamin died from a snake's bite, as it is said of it: הוא ישופך ראש (he will strike your head). And in this verse there is a peh in every single word, to teach that he had a mouth yet did not reveal about his brothers in the sale of Joseph."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:14.883075426Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}